Keep nation identities separate from filtered list positions.

The initial visible page and random selection must use the actual filtered
nation set. Include taken entries in scroll geometry, disable them when
creating the list, and tolerate absent widgets when availability changes.

--- a/client/gui-sdl2/dialogs.c
